second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the album \\\"Plays Well with Others\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 172, \"text\": \"Doesn't Play Well with Others Doesn't Play Well with Others is the second full-length solo album by Lagwagon and Bad Astronaut frontman Joey Cape, released on June 1, 2011.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00\", \"start\": 173, \"end\": 301, \"text\": \"It was released with one song at a time, each month, during 2010 on Joey Cape's official website, beginning on January 18, 2010.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00\", \"start\": 302, \"end\": 474, \"text\": \"The first track \\\"Going for the Bronze\\\" was released on January 18, 2010, while the last track \\\"I Always Knew This Was Going to End Badly\\\" was released on December 12, 2010.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00\", \"start\": 475, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"Cape's daughter Violet drew the pictures which are used as the artwork for each of the\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Plays Well with Others (Greg Koch album) Plays Well with Others is a studio album by American guitarist Greg Koch.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 132, \"text\": \"Released in 2013.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 133, \"end\": 218, \"text\": \"Several accomplished and well known musicians performed on this album with Greg Koch.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 219, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \"This album including guitarists: Joe Bonamassa Robben Ford, Paul Barrère.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 350, \"text\": \"Roscoe Beck was featured on bass and Jon Cleary on piano.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"start\": 351, \"end\": 622, \"text\": \"The album was released in 2013 and Matt Blacket of Guitar Player Magazine said this about the album, \\\"Over the course of a single tune, Koch will burn through Albert Lee-style Tele shred, Chet Atkins-approved hybrid picking, Danny Gatton-esque jazzabilly, and Three Kings\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"Plays Well with Others\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Joey Cape is the artist of the album \\\"Plays Well with Others\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Joey Cape\", \"quote\": \"Doesn't Play Well with Others Doesn't Play Well with Others is the second full-length solo album by Lagwagon and Bad Astronaut frontman Joey Cape, released on June 1, 2011.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0243-1783b512afda:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"Plays Well with Others\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Greg Koch is the artist of the album \\\"Plays Well with Others\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Greg Koch\", \"quote\": \"Plays Well with Others (Greg Koch album) Plays Well with Others is a studio album by American guitarist Greg Koch.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Greg Koch\", \"Joey Cape\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Greg Koch\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Joey Cape\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
